# Control programs retrieved from the Crestron processors.
#
# These are the complete, compiled control programs for a private residence, and
# this repository is public. The `.dsc` descriptors and manifests in
# docs/crestron/dumps/ are committed deliberately; the programs themselves and
# anything derived from them by bulk extraction are not.
#
# See docs/crestron/crestron-xpanel-control-path.md ("Retrieving the program")
# for how to re-fetch one in about four seconds when it is needed.
docs/crestron/dumps/*.bin
docs/crestron/dumps/*.strings.txt
# The TSW-752 panel project, same reasoning: it is the previous owner's compiled
# interface for this house. crestron-tsw-panel-control-path.md has the re-fetch command.
docs/crestron/dumps/*.xml
